@startuml P231_oid4vci_issue_authorization_code_simple

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' Settings
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
'=== Header and Footer ===
header OPEN-DID Technical Specification
footer
  	Page %page% of %lastpage% at %date("yyyy-MM-dd hh:mm:ss")
end footer

'=== Title ===
title
	<size:25>P231 : OID4VCI VC Issuance (Authorization Code)</size>
end title

'=== Options ===
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"

'=== Panticipants ===
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 500
skinparam MinClassWidth 80


actor USER

box Mobile #OldLace
    participant "**Wallet**" as WALLET <<Wallet>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box Issuing Provider #AliceBlue
    participant "**Issuance Service**" as SERVICE <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**Credential Issuer**" as CI <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**Authorization Server**" as AS <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

box Trusted Storage
    participant "**blockchain**" as BC <<Storage>> #WhiteSmoke
end box


'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' Constants
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

!$refdoc = "Refer to separate document"
!$doc = "Refer to data specification document"

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' Content
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
|||

== P231-1 : Create Credential Offer ==
SERVICE -> CI++: Create Credential Offer request
    rnote right of SERVICE #Lavender
        **[M231_REQ : Create Credential Offer request]**
    end note
return Create Credential Offer response
rnote right of SERVICE #Lavender
    **[M231_RES : Create Credential Offer response]**
end note
SERVICE -> USER: Display QR code

== P231-2 : Retrieve Credential Offer ==
USER -> WALLET: Scan QR
activate WALLET
WALLET -> CI++: Retrieve Credential Offer request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M231_REQ : Retrieve Credential Offer request]**
    end note
    CI -> CI: Generate issuer_state
return Retrieve Credential Offer response
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M231_RES : Retrieve Credential Offer response]**
end note

== P231-3 : Retrieve Metadata ==
WALLET -> CI++: Retrieve Credential Issuer Metadata request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M231_REQ : Retrieve Credential Issuer Metadata request]**
    end note
return Retrieve Credential Issuer Metadata response
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M231_RES : Retrieve Credential Issuer Metadata response]**
end note
WALLET -> AS++: Retrieve Authorization Server Metadata request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M231_REQ : Retrieve Authorization Server Metadata request]**
    end note
return Retrieve Authorization Server Metadata response
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M231_RES : Retrieve Authorization Server Metadata response]**
end note

== P231-4 : Authorization Request ==
WALLET -> AS++: Authorization request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M231_REQ : Authorization request]**
    end note
    AS -> USER: Login screen
    USER -> AS: Login (user authentication)
    AS -> AS: Generate authorization code (code)
return Authorization response (Redirect)
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M231_RES : Authorization response]**
end note

== P231-5 : Request Access Token ==
WALLET -> AS++: Token request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M231_REQ : Token request]**
    end note
    AS -> AS: Verify authorization code and Client, generate access_token
    opt When authorization_details is requested
        AS -> CI++: Retrieve Credential Identifier request
        return Retrieve Credential Identifier response
    end
return Token response
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M231_RES : Token response]**
end note

== P231-6 : Request c_nonce and Credential ==
WALLET -> CI++: c_nonce request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M231_REQ : c_nonce request]**
    end note
return c_nonce response
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M231_RES : c_nonce response]**
end note
WALLET -> WALLET: Generate and sign Proof JWT
WALLET -> CI++: Credential request
    rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
        **[M231_REQ : Credential request]**
    end note
    CI <-> BC: Retrieve Holder DID Document
    CI -> CI: Verify Proof and generate Credential (same as P230-6)
return Credential response
rnote right of WALLET #Lavender
    **[M231_RES : Credential response]**
end note
WALLET -> WALLET: Verify and store Credential
deactivate WALLET

@enduml
